  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine - Expansion of a production facility for hatchery equipment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a financing from DGGF, HatchTech Group will be able to expand its production facility for the production of hatchery equipment in Ukraine. HatchTech Group is a holding company of a leading technology driven company group in the field of hatchery equipment. The group is directing the sector to more animal friendly solutions and sells to clients in 41 different countries, mainly Europe, the America&#x2019;s, Australia and Japan.
The company focuses on manufacturing equipment for sustainable food solutions worldwide. Produced equipment includes climate controlled incubation and hatchery systems, climate controlled transport, climate controlled cultivation and in-egg gender identification systems. R&amp;D, development and testing are done from The Netherlands, while production mainly takes place in company&#x2019;s central production facility in Ukraine.
HatchTech Group wishes to increase its production from Ukraine to meet the growing market demand. Therefore further expansion of the production facilities is needed, for which a loan of EUR 8,5 million is requested. Besides the expansion of the existing production of hatchery equipment, the company intends to start the production of egg gender sorting equipment.
The investment will create ~100 direct jobs in production in Ukraine. Moreover, the company is producing more animal friendly systems which are sold worldwide, contributing to improved animal welfare. The innovative systems are developed while considering efficient use of energy and resources.</narrative>
  </description>
